    content: "In stream channels, topics serve as a data flow management mechanism. This feature allows you to subscribe to, distribute, and notify events related to data streams within stream channels. By leveraging topics effectively, you can significantly reduce business complexity and enhance development efficiency. The main functions of topics are as follows:"
